01:02:59.489 --> 01:03:01.491
My feet. Why can'’t I
use my beautiful feet?


01:03:01.666 --> 01:03:03.145
Heh-heh![Rockwell] Because...


01:03:03.319 --> 01:03:06.366
this vault is armed
with variable gravity.


01:03:06.540 --> 01:03:07.759
[straining]


01:03:07.933 --> 01:03:08.760
No kidding.


01:03:08.934 --> 01:03:10.718
[Rockwell] Green goes up...


01:03:10.892 --> 01:03:13.068
and red takes you down... hard.


01:03:13.242 --> 01:03:14.417
Rockwell, listen to me.


01:03:14.592 --> 01:03:16.376
The Robotniks are planning to--
[yelps]


01:03:16.550 --> 01:03:18.465
Oh, they'’re planning on stealing
a second key, just like you are?


01:03:18.639 --> 01:03:20.032
Yes, I'’m aware.


01:03:21.555 --> 01:03:24.079
I called it
the second Commander Walters was attacked.


01:03:24.253 --> 01:03:25.733
So...


01:03:25.907 --> 01:03:28.475
thank you
for taking the bait


01:03:28.649 --> 01:03:30.129
and falling
right into my trap.


01:03:30.303 --> 01:03:32.435
I don'’t believe this.


01:03:32.610 --> 01:03:34.220
[Gerald]
I know, grandson.


01:03:34.394 --> 01:03:36.396
A woman in the military!


01:03:38.311 --> 01:03:39.747
Let'’s go.


01:03:40.835 --> 01:03:42.054
Go, positions!


01:03:42.228 --> 01:03:43.316
Full perimeter.


01:03:43.490 --> 01:03:44.709
[weapons powering up]


01:03:44.883 --> 01:03:46.188
Robotnik.


01:03:46.362 --> 01:03:48.626
Going full spandex, huh?
Who'’s the fossil?


01:03:48.800 --> 01:03:52.934
That'’s my grandfather,
you dough-eating dimbecile.


01:03:53.108 --> 01:03:56.198
Who are they?A couple of bleeding hearts,


01:03:56.372 --> 01:03:59.201
here to rescue
their emotional-support animals.


01:03:59.375 --> 01:04:01.160
Enough! It'’s over.


01:04:01.334 --> 01:04:04.903
The only way
you'’re leaving here is in handcuffs.


01:04:05.077 --> 01:04:06.774
There is no other way out.


01:04:06.948 --> 01:04:09.734
You know, there might be
one other way out.


01:04:09.908 --> 01:04:11.300
And what is that
supposed to mean?


01:04:11.474 --> 01:04:13.389
[Sonic] Hey, big guy,
I think it'’s time to...


01:04:14.564 --> 01:04:17.872
Break glass
in case of emergency!


01:04:19.831 --> 01:04:21.876
[roaring]


01:04:22.747 --> 01:04:24.009
[grunts]


01:04:25.010 --> 01:04:28.056
Ha! Nothing can stop
Team Knuckles!


01:04:28.230 --> 01:04:29.318
Open fire!


01:04:30.319 --> 01:04:32.191
[yelps] Knuckles,
turn this stuff off!


01:04:32.365 --> 01:04:33.671
Hurry!On it.


01:04:35.281 --> 01:04:36.369
Uh-oh.


01:04:36.543 --> 01:04:38.501
[all yelling in surprise]


01:04:38.676 --> 01:04:40.678
[grunting]


01:04:43.985 --> 01:04:46.335
Ha! See how you like it--
[groans]


01:04:46.509 --> 01:04:48.511
[yelping]


01:04:50.078 --> 01:04:51.863
[both gasp]


01:04:52.037 --> 01:04:53.691
[all groaning]


01:04:53.865 --> 01:04:55.910
Can you move?No, not at all.


01:04:56.084 --> 01:04:58.521
Tails, can you?No, I'’m stuck.


01:04:58.696 --> 01:05:00.088
We might be here a while.


01:05:00.262 --> 01:05:02.264
[growls, grunts]


01:05:02.438 --> 01:05:04.702
Whoa! Whoa. Whoa. Whoa.


01:05:05.703 --> 01:05:07.139
Where'’s the key?


01:05:13.058 --> 01:05:14.276
Whoa!


01:05:14.450 --> 01:05:17.105
What was that?We might have a problem.


01:05:18.759 --> 01:05:20.718
[grunts] No, no, no, no!


01:05:21.893 --> 01:05:24.373
[grunting]


01:05:28.377 --> 01:05:29.988
[exclaims]


01:05:30.902 --> 01:05:31.990
[huffs]


01:05:41.434 --> 01:05:43.523
I'’m moving.


01:05:44.306 --> 01:05:45.917
I'’m moving!


01:05:49.094 --> 01:05:51.531
You go get it, grandson!


01:05:52.271 --> 01:05:53.315
Hey!


01:05:53.489 --> 01:05:55.317
Oh, whoa, whoa...


01:05:57.842 --> 01:05:59.713
No. No, no!


01:06:00.322 --> 01:06:02.020
I'’m almost there!


01:06:04.849 --> 01:06:05.632
Whoa!


01:06:05.806 --> 01:06:07.199
[groaning]


01:06:10.811 --> 01:06:12.378
Sonic!


01:06:18.819 --> 01:06:21.517
[gasps][all yelling, grunting]


01:06:21.691 --> 01:06:22.562
[heavy grunt]


01:06:23.955 --> 01:06:25.260
[yells]


01:06:25.434 --> 01:06:27.785
That was so not worth it!


01:06:28.786 --> 01:06:29.917
Ooh!


01:06:33.051 --> 01:06:34.792
You okay?Yeah. You good?


01:06:34.966 --> 01:06:35.705
Sonic!


01:06:35.880 --> 01:06:37.707
[Tom] Hey.[groaning]


01:06:37.882 --> 01:06:41.102
Sonic, one,
concrete boulder, zero.


01:06:41.276 --> 01:06:42.234
[sighing]


01:06:42.408 --> 01:06:43.713
Thanks for the save.


01:06:43.888 --> 01:06:45.411
Cutting it a little close,
don'’t you think?


01:06:46.847 --> 01:06:48.196
Secure the room!


01:06:50.198 --> 01:06:51.417
She'’s got the key.


01:06:54.159 --> 01:06:55.247
I got an idea.


01:07:04.473 --> 01:07:05.910
Commander Walters.


01:07:06.084 --> 01:07:07.172
Sir.


01:07:07.346 --> 01:07:08.956
You'’re...Still alive?


01:07:09.130 --> 01:07:11.916
I'’ll die before I let that key
fall into the wrong hands.


01:07:12.786 --> 01:07:14.179
Thanks for keeping it safe.


01:07:14.353 --> 01:07:15.833
I'’ll take it from here.


01:07:18.531 --> 01:07:20.359
That'’s an order,
Director Rockwell.


01:07:24.058 --> 01:07:26.713
Now, organize
the reinforcements.


01:07:28.062 --> 01:07:29.150
Yes, sir.


01:07:34.895 --> 01:07:37.115
Guys, guys, I got the key.
I repeat, I got the key.


01:07:37.289 --> 01:07:38.899
Now let'’s get out of here.


01:07:43.121 --> 01:07:45.384
Commander Walters.


01:07:45.558 --> 01:07:47.255
No, no. No. Wait!


01:08:01.530 --> 01:08:02.967
What?


01:08:03.141 --> 01:08:05.665
Tom! Everyone'’s clear!
Come on, let'’s go!


01:08:05.839 --> 01:08:07.710
You. What are you--


01:08:09.408 --> 01:08:10.452
Tom!


01:08:11.584 --> 01:08:13.629
Tom. Tom, what happened?


01:08:13.803 --> 01:08:15.327
Speak to me. Come on.


01:08:15.501 --> 01:08:17.677
Come on,
it'’s gonna be okay.


01:08:17.851 --> 01:08:20.898
Please, please, please get up.
Hey, come on, please wake up.


01:08:21.072 --> 01:08:22.682
Wake up, wake up, come on.


01:08:23.378 --> 01:08:24.771
Wake up, wake up, wake up!


01:08:25.467 --> 01:08:26.904
Maria.


01:08:30.951 --> 01:08:32.648
What did you do?


01:08:34.868 --> 01:08:36.914
What I had to.


01:08:39.568 --> 01:08:41.266
Oh, my God. Tom!


01:08:44.486 --> 01:08:46.184
Help me up, kid.


01:08:46.358 --> 01:08:47.925
[grunting]


01:08:49.013 --> 01:08:50.318
Freeze! Don'’t move!


01:08:50.492 --> 01:08:55.367
Any tricks up your sleeve,
Captain Grandtastic?


01:08:55.541 --> 01:08:56.977
[soldiers grunting]


01:08:59.197 --> 01:09:00.415
[terrified yelp]


01:09:02.113 --> 01:09:04.158
We got what we came for.


01:09:04.898 --> 01:09:07.770
Great job, Shadow.


01:09:08.510 --> 01:09:11.383
We have both keys.


01:09:11.557 --> 01:09:14.342
So where'’s your little
science project?


01:09:15.735 --> 01:09:19.695
It'’s closer than you think,
my boy.


01:09:21.871 --> 01:09:23.395
Welcome...[yelps]


01:09:23.569 --> 01:09:26.920
...to my masterpiece!


01:09:29.836 --> 01:09:31.577
I must hand it to GUN.


01:09:31.751 --> 01:09:35.189
They built her
to my exact specifications.


01:09:35.363 --> 01:09:36.538
It'’s...


01:09:38.192 --> 01:09:39.759
remarkable!


01:09:39.933 --> 01:09:41.152
Mm-hmm.


01:09:41.326 --> 01:09:44.155
Astounding!Yes.


01:09:45.286 --> 01:09:47.419
That'’s my genius grand-genome!


01:09:47.593 --> 01:09:51.205
And I have one more surprise.


01:09:53.686 --> 01:09:57.690
It'’s a new suit!


01:10:01.433 --> 01:10:03.348
[giddy squealing]


01:10:04.914 --> 01:10:07.091
[excited grunting]


01:10:07.265 --> 01:10:08.092
Gee.


01:10:08.266 --> 01:10:09.876
[smooching]


01:10:10.572 --> 01:10:12.618
[grunting]


01:10:27.633 --> 01:10:30.027
♪ <i>I'’m a chip</i>
<i>Off the old block</i>♪


01:10:30.201 --> 01:10:32.290
♪ <i>I'’m a chip</i>
<i>Off the old block</i>♪


01:10:32.464 --> 01:10:35.249
♪ <i>I'’m a chip off</i>
<i>The old block!</i>♪


01:10:35.423 --> 01:10:36.729
[ring tone chiming]


01:10:36.903 --> 01:10:38.818
What do you want, Stone?
I'’m busy.


01:10:38.992 --> 01:10:41.995
Doctor, I have a bad feeling
about this.


01:10:42.169 --> 01:10:45.129
I don'’t think your grandfather'’s
been completely honest with us.


01:10:45.303 --> 01:10:47.000
It was something Shadow said.


01:10:47.783 --> 01:10:49.002
<i>There'’s more to their plan.</i>


01:10:50.438 --> 01:10:53.485
How dare you!


01:10:53.659 --> 01:10:56.444
You have been jealous
of my long-lost grand-Pop-Tart


01:10:56.618 --> 01:10:58.751
since the very beginning!


01:10:58.925 --> 01:11:01.580
I no longer require
your obsequious groveling.


01:11:01.754 --> 01:11:04.235
<i>Consider this your notice</i>
<i>of termination.</i>


01:11:04.409 --> 01:11:07.803
Your letter of reference
will be L for Loser.


01:11:07.977 --> 01:11:09.805
Of course,
I'’ll expect you to stay on


01:11:09.979 --> 01:11:11.459
until you'’ve been
successfully cloned.


01:11:11.633 --> 01:11:15.115
But you and I are done!


01:11:15.289 --> 01:11:17.726
Like a blackened
catfish dinner!


01:11:17.900 --> 01:11:21.165
Sir, it'’s too dangerous and
I'’m not there to protect you.


01:11:21.339 --> 01:11:22.470
I already lost you once! I--


01:11:22.644 --> 01:11:24.777
Unsubscribe.
Blocked and reported.


01:11:25.995 --> 01:11:27.910
[breath shaking]
I can'’t lose you again.


01:11:29.825 --> 01:11:31.436
[sighs]


01:11:34.352 --> 01:11:35.918
Do the honors...


01:11:36.658 --> 01:11:37.833
grandson.


01:11:39.748 --> 01:11:41.054
Here we go.


01:12:07.385 --> 01:12:09.561
[excited chatter]


01:12:44.248 --> 01:12:47.294
[sirens wailing][indistinct radio chatter]


01:13:07.140 --> 01:13:09.316
[siren wails]


01:13:15.322 --> 01:13:17.063
It'’ll be okay, Sonic.


01:13:17.237 --> 01:13:18.891
It'’ll be okay?


01:13:19.065 --> 01:13:21.589
Tom is fighting for his life
and you think it'’ll be okay?


01:13:21.763 --> 01:13:24.984
The fox is simply trying
to comfort you.


01:13:25.158 --> 01:13:27.029
Comfort'’s not
what I need right now.


01:13:27.204 --> 01:13:30.337
I need to stop them.
By any means necessary.


01:13:30.511 --> 01:13:31.686
Wait, you don'’t mean--


01:13:31.860 --> 01:13:33.949
The Master Emerald.


01:13:34.123 --> 01:13:37.301
The Emerald must never be
wielded for vengeance.


01:13:37.475 --> 01:13:38.519
Not ever!


01:13:38.693 --> 01:13:40.347
We swore a sacred oath.


01:13:40.521 --> 01:13:42.480
Don'’t talk to me about oaths.
Not now!


01:13:42.654 --> 01:13:44.525
But you told Tom
using the Emerald


01:13:44.699 --> 01:13:46.135
wasn'’t the right choice.


01:13:46.310 --> 01:13:48.399
Well, now it'’s the only choice.


01:13:48.573 --> 01:13:50.357
And if neither of you
have the guts to help me,


01:13:50.531 --> 01:13:51.967
then I'’ll do it alone.


01:13:52.141 --> 01:13:54.231
But I thought
the three of us were a team.


01:13:54.405 --> 01:13:56.407
I thought that'’s what
made us special.


01:13:56.581 --> 01:13:58.365
I'’m not asking you twice,
Knuckles.


01:13:59.236 --> 01:14:02.064
Where is the Master Emerald?


01:14:03.805 --> 01:14:07.156
Your heart is being consumed
by anger, hedgehog.


01:14:07.331 --> 01:14:10.377
You are in no condition
to make decisions right now.


01:14:10.551 --> 01:14:13.119
I know you'’re upset about Tom.
We all are.


01:14:13.293 --> 01:14:14.990
Last chance.


01:14:15.164 --> 01:14:17.776
Where... is it?


01:14:18.342 --> 01:14:19.865
Don'’t do this.


01:14:26.524 --> 01:14:29.483
Part of our oath
is to trust each other.


01:14:29.657 --> 01:14:31.877
And I must abide
by that promise,


01:14:32.051 --> 01:14:34.358
even if you have chosen
to break it.


01:14:34.532 --> 01:14:36.273
But heed this warning:


01:14:36.447 --> 01:14:39.798
The Master Emerald is guarded
by a fearsome warrior.


01:14:39.972 --> 01:14:42.148
And to seize
this ultimate power,


01:14:42.322 --> 01:14:44.237
you will have to go...


01:14:44.411 --> 01:14:46.457
through him.


01:14:46.631 --> 01:14:47.762
[exhales deeply]


01:14:47.936 --> 01:14:50.548
Okay, Wade...
all comes down to this.


01:14:51.288 --> 01:14:52.941
Last few seconds.


01:14:53.115 --> 01:14:54.247
Whipple down the ice.


01:14:54.421 --> 01:14:57.946
He shoots... he scores!


01:14:58.120 --> 01:15:01.167
Wade Whipple
is a champion again!


01:15:01.341 --> 01:15:02.516
[cackles]


01:15:07.086 --> 01:15:10.263
Oh, hey, Sonic. See my goal?
Pretty sick, right?


01:15:10.437 --> 01:15:12.265
I'’m here for the Emerald.


01:15:12.439 --> 01:15:13.962
Look, Sonic, I'’m sorry.


01:15:14.136 --> 01:15:16.313
I promised to guard this emerald
with my life.


01:15:16.487 --> 01:15:18.315
I will do whatever it takes--


01:15:19.446 --> 01:15:20.534
Well, I tried.


01:15:22.449 --> 01:15:24.669
[thunder rumbling]


01:15:25.974 --> 01:15:26.975
[Wade] Sonic!


01:15:30.892 --> 01:15:31.893
Too bright!


01:15:35.506 --> 01:15:38.552
[woman] <i>This is an urgent </i>
<i>national emergency broadcast.</i>


01:15:38.726 --> 01:15:41.163
<i>A spacecraft designed</i>
<i>by the agency GUN</i>


01:15:41.338 --> 01:15:44.253
<i>has been hijacked and launched </i>
<i>out of the River Thames.</i>


01:15:44.428 --> 01:15:48.040
[man broadcasting in Japanese]


01:15:50.042 --> 01:15:53.088
[man] <i>All residents are urged </i>
<i>to seek immediate shelter.</i>


01:16:15.154 --> 01:16:17.417
[Gerald] It'’s time, Shadow.


01:16:19.071 --> 01:16:23.162
Professor, is this really
what Maria would have wanted?


01:16:25.947 --> 01:16:29.298
The question isn'’t
what Maria would have wanted.


01:16:30.430 --> 01:16:32.432
It'’s what do they deserve.


01:16:33.433 --> 01:16:35.914
Remember what she meant to us.


01:16:37.785 --> 01:16:40.701
Remember what they took from us.


01:16:51.146 --> 01:16:52.191
[Gerald] Kids!


01:16:52.365 --> 01:16:54.280
We have to go, now!


01:16:54.454 --> 01:16:56.064
[Maria panting]


01:16:59.503 --> 01:17:01.940
[Gerald] They want to take
Shadow away from us, Maria!


01:17:06.771 --> 01:17:07.946
[weapons charging]


01:17:10.557 --> 01:17:13.255
Hey! Hey! What are you doing?
Those are children.


01:17:13.430 --> 01:17:15.214
We'’ve got our orders, Walters!Stand down!


01:17:16.868 --> 01:17:18.739
[gasps]


01:17:26.617 --> 01:17:28.619
[muffled rumbling]


01:17:30.011 --> 01:17:31.230
[high-pitched whistling]


01:17:31.404 --> 01:17:33.145
[groaning]


01:17:39.064 --> 01:17:40.282
Huh?


01:17:41.849 --> 01:17:42.937
Maria!


01:18:16.667 --> 01:18:18.059
[angry roar]


01:18:18.712 --> 01:18:20.497
[panting heavily]


01:18:30.419 --> 01:18:33.422
Excuse me,
Grand Paso Doble.


01:18:33.597 --> 01:18:36.556
What is that thermonuclear
gerbil doing?


01:18:36.730 --> 01:18:39.080
[Gerald] Infusing the core...


01:18:39.254 --> 01:18:40.734
with chaos energy.


01:18:40.908 --> 01:18:43.520
That'’s my little secret.


01:18:43.694 --> 01:18:46.305
The Eclipse Cannon
is about to turn this planet


01:18:46.479 --> 01:18:49.264
into a flaming pile
of rubble,


01:18:49.438 --> 01:18:54.269
wiping out everything
in a 25,000-mile radius.


01:18:57.446 --> 01:18:59.623
Including us.


01:19:03.540 --> 01:19:04.802
What?


01:19:05.716 --> 01:19:08.806
We can'’t annihilate
the Earth!


01:19:08.980 --> 01:19:13.419
Hmm?By combining our genius,
we can rule humanity.


01:19:13.593 --> 01:19:14.507
Together!


01:19:14.681 --> 01:19:17.771
Humanity is a failed experiment.


01:19:17.945 --> 01:19:20.165
If anyone should know that,
it'’s you.


01:19:21.906 --> 01:19:24.822
All your life, you'’ve been
rejected by this world.


01:19:25.692 --> 01:19:27.346
You have nothing down there.


01:19:28.956 --> 01:19:31.002
No one who cares about you.


01:19:32.786 --> 01:19:34.353
But I have you now.


01:19:37.051 --> 01:19:38.444
We'’re family.


01:19:39.358 --> 01:19:40.968
We have each other.


01:19:42.448 --> 01:19:43.710
Oh, Ivo...


01:19:45.538 --> 01:19:47.235
you'’re no Maria.


01:19:50.587 --> 01:19:54.547
The moment I lost her,
my family was gone forever!


01:19:56.201 --> 01:19:57.942
The only way
to give Maria'’s life meaning


01:19:58.116 --> 01:20:00.379
is to destroy the world
that took her from me.


01:20:01.249 --> 01:20:03.382
So I'’m burning it all down!


01:20:06.080 --> 01:20:07.255
It'’s done.


01:20:07.429 --> 01:20:09.736
Good work, Shadow.


01:20:09.910 --> 01:20:11.782
I'’m prepping
the firing sequence.


01:20:11.956 --> 01:20:15.829
The weapon will be fully charged
in ten minutes.


01:20:19.790 --> 01:20:21.879
It'’s almost finished, Maria.


01:20:22.793 --> 01:20:25.143
You will have justice.


01:20:25.317 --> 01:20:26.927
[muffled, distant boom]


01:20:29.538 --> 01:20:30.844
What is that?


01:20:31.758 --> 01:20:34.718
Is GUN launching
missiles at us?


01:20:34.892 --> 01:20:37.938
Impossible.
It'’s moving too fast.


01:20:41.159 --> 01:20:42.682
It'’s him.


01:20:47.034 --> 01:20:48.340
[wind whistling]


01:20:48.514 --> 01:20:49.994
[both grunting]


01:20:51.169 --> 01:20:55.477
You hurt my family.
This ends now!


01:20:55.652 --> 01:20:57.349
Now you know my anger.


01:20:57.523 --> 01:21:00.395
The pain I'’ve felt
for 50 years.


01:21:00.569 --> 01:21:03.834
And you'’ve made
the same choice I did.


01:21:04.008 --> 01:21:05.574
I'’m nothing like you!


01:21:05.749 --> 01:21:06.837
We'’ll see.


01:21:07.011 --> 01:21:09.448
[both yelling]


01:21:14.671 --> 01:21:16.281
Show yourself, coward!


01:21:17.499 --> 01:21:18.675
[grunts]


01:21:20.415 --> 01:21:21.503
[grunts]


01:21:22.330 --> 01:21:23.288
[gasps]


01:21:32.253 --> 01:21:34.473
[screams]


01:21:45.266 --> 01:21:46.528
[shouts]


01:21:46.703 --> 01:21:47.921
[thunder reverberating]


01:21:48.095 --> 01:21:49.749
You were right about one thing.


01:21:49.923 --> 01:21:50.968
[straining]


01:21:51.620 --> 01:21:53.971
This ends now.


01:21:54.667 --> 01:21:57.191
[both grunting]


01:22:20.562 --> 01:22:21.607
What'’s happening?


01:22:21.781 --> 01:22:22.913
Where are they?


01:22:23.957 --> 01:22:25.219
Up there.Where?


01:22:25.393 --> 01:22:26.307
Higher.Hmm?


01:22:26.481 --> 01:22:27.874
[shocked gagging]


01:22:28.048 --> 01:22:29.310
Left yourself open.


01:22:29.484 --> 01:22:31.269
Ivo! What are you doing?


01:22:31.443 --> 01:22:32.836
Thwarting your evil plan!


01:22:39.407 --> 01:22:41.322
[both howling in pain]


01:22:43.760 --> 01:22:45.718
Not the mustache!Agreed.


01:22:45.892 --> 01:22:48.590
Let go on three.
One, two, three!


01:22:49.374 --> 01:22:50.854
[whiskers flapping]


01:22:51.028 --> 01:22:52.203
[beeps]


01:22:53.770 --> 01:22:57.034
[mocking]
Oh... a nano-fist.


01:22:57.208 --> 01:23:00.907
I haven'’t seen that
since I hate-watched <i>Green Lantern</i>in 2011.


01:23:01.081 --> 01:23:03.040
I was saving it for Comic-Con.


01:23:03.214 --> 01:23:05.259
But now there won'’t
be a Comic-Con!


01:23:05.433 --> 01:23:06.478
[yells]


01:23:09.176 --> 01:23:10.787
[both grunting]


01:23:18.925 --> 01:23:21.145
[dust settling]


01:23:27.891 --> 01:23:30.937
Why are you alone?
Where are your friends?


01:23:31.111 --> 01:23:32.634
[straining]


01:23:32.809 --> 01:23:35.202
They tried to stop you,
didn'’t they?


01:23:35.376 --> 01:23:36.856
But you came anyway.


01:23:37.030 --> 01:23:39.467
Your anger was too much.


01:23:39.641 --> 01:23:42.383
What kind of hero
abandons his friends


01:23:42.557 --> 01:23:44.603
to pursue revenge?


01:23:44.777 --> 01:23:47.084
Abandons his family!


01:23:47.258 --> 01:23:49.869
Don'’t you dare talk
about my family.


01:23:50.043 --> 01:23:52.785
And here I thought
you cared for them.


01:23:52.959 --> 01:23:56.093
Especially the one...
What'’s his name?


01:23:56.267 --> 01:23:57.485
Tom?


01:23:57.659 --> 01:23:59.661
[angry howl]


01:24:17.984 --> 01:24:19.681
[Sonic yelling][gasps]


01:24:21.596 --> 01:24:23.685
[strained panting]


01:24:23.860 --> 01:24:26.253
Go ahead. Finish it!


01:24:27.951 --> 01:24:30.301
What are you waiting for? Do it!


01:24:30.475 --> 01:24:33.043
[grunting]I'’m right here!


01:24:34.218 --> 01:24:36.350
You didn'’t let your pain
change who you are...


01:24:37.786 --> 01:24:38.831
in here.


01:24:40.920 --> 01:24:42.704
[whimpering sigh]


01:24:47.274 --> 01:24:49.233
This is not who I am.


01:24:49.929 --> 01:24:51.583
What are you doing?


01:24:51.757 --> 01:24:54.629
You won. Take your revenge.


01:24:56.501 --> 01:24:58.633
There are no winners
with revenge.


01:25:11.951 --> 01:25:13.692
[Maria] <i>Wow.</i>


01:25:13.866 --> 01:25:15.302
[voice echoing]
Look at all those stars.


01:25:16.782 --> 01:25:18.392
<i>They'’re like diamonds.</i>


01:25:20.655 --> 01:25:24.007
The last time I sat
beneath stars like this...


01:25:26.009 --> 01:25:27.575
I was with her.


01:25:29.142 --> 01:25:31.666
I'’ve felt this pain for so long.


01:25:33.364 --> 01:25:35.061
It'’s all I know.


01:25:35.235 --> 01:25:37.455
When I lost Longclaw...


01:25:37.629 --> 01:25:39.326
I felt the same way.


01:25:41.111 --> 01:25:43.548
Did your pain eventually
go away?


01:25:43.722 --> 01:25:45.680
No.


01:25:45.854 --> 01:25:47.769
But in time,
I learned there'’s something


01:25:47.944 --> 01:25:50.250
even more powerful than pain.


01:25:50.424 --> 01:25:52.513
The love we felt for each other.


01:25:53.732 --> 01:25:55.560
That'’s what you need
to hold on to, Shadow.


01:25:55.734 --> 01:25:57.954
Maria might be gone,


01:25:58.128 --> 01:26:00.130
but your love
will always remain.


01:26:14.796 --> 01:26:18.800
"The light shines
even though the star is gone."


01:26:23.892 --> 01:26:25.807
[cannon rumbling in distance]


01:26:30.638 --> 01:26:32.553
This whole mess
is my fault.


01:26:32.727 --> 01:26:35.556
I'’ve been so blinded by rage,
I thought...


01:26:36.253 --> 01:26:38.037
I had no choice.


01:26:41.562 --> 01:26:43.956
You always have a choice.


01:26:48.917 --> 01:26:51.659
But making the right one
is never easy.


01:26:51.833 --> 01:26:53.531
One more thing I learned


01:26:53.705 --> 01:26:56.490
is that when you
really screw something up,


01:26:56.664 --> 01:26:58.144
you can'’t fix it
on your own.


01:26:58.318 --> 01:27:00.538
["Live and Learn"
by Crush 40 playing]


01:27:13.333 --> 01:27:14.987
Gotta go fast.


01:27:15.161 --> 01:27:17.511
Don'’t tell me you'’ve
got a catchphrase.


01:27:17.685 --> 01:27:21.037
That'’s right, new hedgehog.
And everyone loves it.


01:27:36.791 --> 01:27:39.968
I... will... not... try...[grunting]


01:27:40.143 --> 01:27:43.102
...to stop... my...
elders... from...


01:27:43.276 --> 01:27:45.670
destroying... the... world!


01:27:46.497 --> 01:27:47.715
[screams]


01:27:51.328 --> 01:27:53.243
Playtime is over.


01:28:01.947 --> 01:28:04.167
There'’s no going back now.


01:28:04.341 --> 01:28:07.300
[wheezing grunts]


01:28:08.345 --> 01:28:10.695
Set up defense.


01:28:12.653 --> 01:28:13.959
Damn you, autocorrect!


01:28:14.133 --> 01:28:15.395
[attacking grunt]


01:28:18.050 --> 01:28:19.138
[shouts]


01:28:19.834 --> 01:28:20.879
Mantis!


01:28:22.837 --> 01:28:24.100
Oh!


01:28:26.189 --> 01:28:27.320
[cackles]


01:28:27.494 --> 01:28:28.582
Whee!


01:28:29.366 --> 01:28:30.497
[hissing growl]


01:28:30.671 --> 01:28:33.283
I'’m right here,
arach-nerd.


01:28:34.022 --> 01:28:34.849
[shouts]


01:28:35.023 --> 01:28:37.765
[both grunting]


01:28:40.464 --> 01:28:43.597
[cackles]


01:28:43.771 --> 01:28:46.513
That'’s what I call
mantis-scaping.


01:28:46.687 --> 01:28:49.125
That'’s elder abuse!


01:28:52.737 --> 01:28:55.043
[exclaims]


01:28:55.218 --> 01:28:58.438
[female computer voice]
<i>Alert! Alert! Alert!</i>


01:28:58.612 --> 01:29:00.005
Shadow...


01:29:00.179 --> 01:29:02.790
I see you'’ve chosen betrayal.


01:29:03.965 --> 01:29:06.620
And you were once
so useful to me.


01:29:22.332 --> 01:29:24.508
Ready to recycle
some tin cans?


01:29:24.682 --> 01:29:26.292
Just try to keep up.


01:29:57.584 --> 01:29:58.977
[Robotnik]
Please, Grampsy,


01:29:59.151 --> 01:30:00.892
don'’t do this!


01:30:01.066 --> 01:30:03.155
Sorry, kiddo.


01:30:03.329 --> 01:30:06.550
Bring Your Grandkid to Work Day
is over.


01:30:06.724 --> 01:30:07.768
[device beeping]


01:30:07.942 --> 01:30:10.031
[air whistling]


01:30:10.206 --> 01:30:12.556
[yelping]


01:30:12.730 --> 01:30:14.514
Any last words?


01:30:14.688 --> 01:30:17.387
Just one thing...


01:30:18.388 --> 01:30:20.477
that I never thought I'’d say.


01:30:20.651 --> 01:30:22.130
What is it?


01:30:22.305 --> 01:30:24.785
"I love you"?


01:30:25.438 --> 01:30:26.744
No.


01:30:26.918 --> 01:30:28.833
It was something even better.


01:30:29.007 --> 01:30:31.096
But I'’m not gonna say it
if that'’s the way you'’re gonna be.


01:30:31.270 --> 01:30:33.229
Okay. Bye.


01:30:34.230 --> 01:30:36.232
[screaming]


01:30:40.540 --> 01:30:42.847
[cackling]


01:30:43.021 --> 01:30:43.978
[hissing inhale]


01:30:44.152 --> 01:30:45.197
[happy grunt]


01:30:46.111 --> 01:30:47.982
Grandchildren.


01:30:48.156 --> 01:30:51.769
All the fun
and none of the responsibility.


01:30:53.901 --> 01:30:56.687
Who said life was pointless?


01:30:57.470 --> 01:31:00.386
Huh?Oh, right. You did.


01:31:00.560 --> 01:31:01.735
[growls][electricity buzzes]


01:31:01.909 --> 01:31:03.520
[screams]


01:31:04.738 --> 01:31:06.044
[faint zap]


01:31:06.218 --> 01:31:07.741
[Tails, Knuckles cheering][Knuckles] Victory!


01:31:07.915 --> 01:31:10.266
Say what you want
about my granddad,


01:31:10.440 --> 01:31:12.268
he made one
hell of a bug zapper.


01:31:13.094 --> 01:31:14.313
[groans softly]


01:31:14.487 --> 01:31:16.315
We got to stop that laser!


01:31:16.489 --> 01:31:18.709
I knew there was something
I was forgetting.


01:31:29.285 --> 01:31:32.462
We'’re out of time.
The cannon is about to fire!


01:31:32.636 --> 01:31:33.854
Where are you?


01:31:34.028 --> 01:31:36.553
Oh, you know,
just making friends.


01:31:36.727 --> 01:31:38.424
They'’re all yours.


01:31:42.036 --> 01:31:43.690
[laughing]


01:31:47.128 --> 01:31:48.652
[Sonic] Follow me!


01:31:54.745 --> 01:31:57.313
Now, this might hurt a little!


01:31:58.531 --> 01:32:00.751
[all exclaiming]


01:32:11.152 --> 01:32:13.938
So this was your plan?


01:32:14.112 --> 01:32:15.635
[straining] Yeah...


01:32:15.809 --> 01:32:19.291
Would someone mind
shutting down the giant death ray?


01:32:21.728 --> 01:32:23.556
We can'’t stop the cannon
from firing...


01:32:23.730 --> 01:32:25.819
But we can steer it away
from the Earth.


01:32:25.993 --> 01:32:28.344
Coming around to starboard.Aye-aye, Doc.


01:32:32.304 --> 01:32:34.350
Here we go.


01:32:35.568 --> 01:32:37.396
[Tails grunting][Robotnik] It'’s a little tight.


01:32:38.179 --> 01:32:40.399
Definitely not power steering.


01:32:46.318 --> 01:32:49.234
Keep... turning.[straining]


01:32:51.845 --> 01:32:53.673
Jump in anytime here, guys!


01:32:53.847 --> 01:32:54.979
[all straining]


01:32:55.153 --> 01:32:56.633
[steady beeping]


01:32:59.331 --> 01:33:03.161
Can'’t... hold... much... longer.


01:33:03.335 --> 01:33:05.293
[all yelling]


01:33:07.208 --> 01:33:09.036
[exhausted groan]


01:33:12.475 --> 01:33:14.085
[groans]


01:33:20.787 --> 01:33:21.919
Yes![cheering]


01:33:22.093 --> 01:33:24.356
I did it! I did it!


01:33:27.664 --> 01:33:29.361
Oh!Ooh!


01:33:30.014 --> 01:33:31.145
Look what you did!


01:33:31.319 --> 01:33:33.931
Hey, look down there!Sonic!


01:33:40.024 --> 01:33:42.113
Oh, Knuckles,
please tell me you have a--


01:33:42.287 --> 01:33:43.984
Last one.


01:33:44.158 --> 01:33:45.551
Let'’s make it count.


01:33:48.119 --> 01:33:50.164
Ready for a little base of ball?


01:33:51.209 --> 01:33:52.819
Deep breath.


01:33:52.993 --> 01:33:55.692
One... two... three!


01:33:56.736 --> 01:33:59.217
[Knuckles grunting]


01:33:59.391 --> 01:34:00.784
[yells]


01:34:16.060 --> 01:34:17.365
[shocked yell]


01:34:17.540 --> 01:34:19.672
Really!What'’s happening?


01:34:19.846 --> 01:34:22.327
The reactor core is overloading.


01:34:22.501 --> 01:34:24.851
It'’s only a matter of time
before it blows.


01:34:25.025 --> 01:34:26.766
So what does that mean
for Earth?


01:34:26.940 --> 01:34:29.595
A radioactive atmosphere.


01:34:29.769 --> 01:34:32.250
Rain that kills the crops
and melts your flesh.


01:34:32.424 --> 01:34:33.686
Other than that...


01:34:33.860 --> 01:34:35.514
We'’re not done here!


01:34:35.688 --> 01:34:37.603
You try to stabilize
the reactor.


01:34:37.777 --> 01:34:38.996
Buy me some time.


01:34:39.170 --> 01:34:41.215
I'’ll push the station
away from Earth


01:34:41.389 --> 01:34:42.826
before it explodes.


01:34:43.000 --> 01:34:47.004
This is our last chance
to do the right thing.


01:34:48.658 --> 01:34:51.269
[in Spanish]
Go with God


01:34:51.443 --> 01:34:53.663
stinking hedgehog.


01:34:54.925 --> 01:34:57.231
[female computer voice]
<i>Core integrity failing.</i>


01:35:06.414 --> 01:35:08.068
I'’ve got you, Sonic!


01:35:10.070 --> 01:35:11.245
[gasps]


01:35:11.419 --> 01:35:13.030
[moans]


01:35:19.689 --> 01:35:21.125
[straining]


01:35:41.406 --> 01:35:44.801
[computer] <i>Initializing</i>
<i>reactor core stabilizers.</i>


01:36:03.515 --> 01:36:06.213
This is Doctor Ivo Robotnik,


01:36:06.387 --> 01:36:09.129
dedicating my final livestream


01:36:09.303 --> 01:36:12.045
to one very special henchman:


01:36:12.655 --> 01:36:14.047
<i>Agent Stone.</i>


01:36:14.221 --> 01:36:16.441
No, no. Doctor, wait!


01:36:16.615 --> 01:36:19.009
<i>If I can'’t</i>
<i>rule the world...</i>


01:36:20.010 --> 01:36:21.838
I might as well save it...


01:36:22.012 --> 01:36:25.145
for the one and only person
who ever cared about me.


01:36:25.319 --> 01:36:27.234
Don'’t do this, Doctor, please!


01:36:27.408 --> 01:36:31.021
Stone, you were more
than a sycophant to me.


01:36:33.893 --> 01:36:35.155
You were...


01:36:36.635 --> 01:36:38.158
a syco-friend.


01:36:43.729 --> 01:36:47.254
I'’ll miss your lattes
with steamed Austrian goat milk.


01:36:49.213 --> 01:36:51.084
I love the way you make '’em!


01:37:34.171 --> 01:37:38.001
So... I guess there'’s
only one thing left to say.


01:37:38.784 --> 01:37:41.221
[mimics robotic servos]


01:37:42.788 --> 01:37:44.268
It'’s been a real drag.


01:37:44.964 --> 01:37:46.444
Thanks for nothing.


01:37:58.630 --> 01:38:00.240
[birds chirping faintly]


01:38:02.199 --> 01:38:03.766
[coughing]


01:38:05.028 --> 01:38:06.203
Sonic, look.


01:38:16.430 --> 01:38:18.302
Shadow and Robotnik.


01:38:18.476 --> 01:38:20.696
They sacrificed
themselves...


01:38:20.870 --> 01:38:22.872
to save everyone.


01:38:23.611 --> 01:38:25.657
You always have a choice.


01:38:26.919 --> 01:38:29.661
Guys, I'’m really sorry
for running off like that.


01:38:29.835 --> 01:38:31.445
I shouldn'’t have
left you behind.


01:38:33.230 --> 01:38:34.840
The truth is...


01:38:35.014 --> 01:38:37.669
you'’re the best teammates
a hedgehog could ever ask for.


01:38:39.410 --> 01:38:41.238
And the best friends.


01:38:41.412 --> 01:38:43.283
Can you ever forgive me?


01:38:47.374 --> 01:38:49.159
Team Sonic?


01:38:53.250 --> 01:38:55.861
[Sonic]
How about just "team"?


01:39:04.174 --> 01:39:05.784
Goodbye, Doctor.


01:39:22.322 --> 01:39:24.629
[Sonic] Big finish.[Knuckles] Mmm!


01:39:26.152 --> 01:39:28.589
Now that'’s
what I call teamwork.


01:39:28.764 --> 01:39:30.548
Okay! It'’s ready!


01:39:30.722 --> 01:39:32.202
[munching]


01:39:32.376 --> 01:39:33.551
[gasps]


01:39:33.725 --> 01:39:35.379
Knuckles,
how could you?


01:39:35.553 --> 01:39:37.381
Gotta be faster than that!


01:39:38.295 --> 01:39:39.383
Give me a break.


01:39:39.557 --> 01:39:40.863
Still moving a little slow
over here.


01:39:41.037 --> 01:39:42.821
Donut Lord!Yay!


01:39:42.995 --> 01:39:44.518
[pained groan]


01:39:44.692 --> 01:39:47.347
Okay, Knuckles, that'’s...I am having the love.


01:39:47.521 --> 01:39:48.871
[barks]
I want the love!


01:39:49.045 --> 01:39:51.743
[Tails] Aww...Get in here, Ozzy.


01:39:51.917 --> 01:39:53.614
It'’s great
to be back together.


01:39:53.789 --> 01:39:55.616
We'’re stronger than ever.


01:39:55.791 --> 01:39:58.228
And nothing is gonna
stand in our way.


01:39:59.577 --> 01:40:03.407
Except that one piece
of unfinished business.


01:40:12.459 --> 01:40:15.462
And way out in front, to the
surprise of absolutely no one,


01:40:15.636 --> 01:40:16.812
it'’s the Blue Blur!


01:40:16.986 --> 01:40:18.726
Often imitated,
never duplicated,


01:40:18.901 --> 01:40:20.119
the one, the only...


01:40:20.293 --> 01:40:21.033
[yells]


01:40:21.207 --> 01:40:22.687
Let'’s do this!


01:40:22.861 --> 01:40:25.037
Yeah! [laughs]


01:40:25.211 --> 01:40:28.301
[yells]All right, boys,
try and keep up.


01:40:28.998 --> 01:40:30.869
[all cheering, whooping]


01:40:35.395 --> 01:40:38.398
["Run It"
by Jelly Roll playing]


01:42:24.722 --> 01:42:28.247
Sonic the Hedgehog
is Family Champion once again!


01:42:28.900 --> 01:42:29.945
Tails?


01:42:30.510 --> 01:42:32.034
Knuckles?


01:42:33.687 --> 01:42:36.647
Okay. Yeah, I overshot
the finish line.


01:42:40.564 --> 01:42:42.044
[electronic whirring]


01:42:45.569 --> 01:42:48.572
[Sonic] Okay,
so how do I get back?


01:42:51.096 --> 01:42:52.837
[weapon powering up]


01:42:53.620 --> 01:42:55.622
[beeping]


01:42:59.975 --> 01:43:01.063
[Sonic] Pro tip:


01:43:01.237 --> 01:43:02.455
If you'’re gonna take a shot


01:43:02.629 --> 01:43:04.762
at the fastest creature
in the universe...


01:43:07.112 --> 01:43:08.722
you'’d better not miss.


01:43:12.552 --> 01:43:15.164
Um... I'’m flattered
by the cosplay,


01:43:15.338 --> 01:43:17.035
but you got
a few details wrong.


01:43:17.209 --> 01:43:20.082
I can'’t blame you, though.
It'’s hard to copy perfection.


01:43:30.179 --> 01:43:32.181
That'’s a neat trick.


01:43:40.798 --> 01:43:42.017
[Sonic yelps]


01:43:44.106 --> 01:43:46.021
What? Who are you?

